# Media stays out of history: big and binary; text rules and scripts are what change.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov
*.aep
*.txt.bak
# Except the SFX library: part of the system.
!SFX_Library/**

# Yours, never overwritten by `git pull`: your rules, your PC paths, your client files.
MY-RULES.md
THIS-PC.md
Kit_04_Clients/*
!Kit_04_Clients/README.md

# API keys never go to GitHub (they live in <parent of Claude-Workflow>\keys\ anyway).
*.env
